<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia March broad money M3 up 21 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Malaysia March broad money M3 up 21 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's broad money M3 expanded by 21 percent year-on-year in March, against 20.4 percent in February, Bank Negara said on Saturday.</p>
<p>Total annual loans growth stood at 29.6 percent at the end of March, unchanged from end-February, the central bank said.  </p>
<p>	   MALAYSIA MONETARY AGGREGATES:</p>
<p>(Percentage change at end of period, year-on-year)</p>
<p>	    March 97     February 97     March 96</p>
<p>  M1	 18.9	     14.2	     15.7</p>
<p>  M2	 20.8	     19.6	     27.2</p>
<p>  M3	 21.0	     20.4	     27.1</p>
<p>Note: M1 - money in circulation and cash on deposit in banks</p>
<p>	 M2 - M1 plus time, savings and foreign currency deposits</p>
<p>	 M3 - broad money</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
